@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = rahasia123

### Menampilkan seluruh mahasiswa
GET {{baseUrl}}/students


### Menambahkan mahasiswa baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "nim": "F1D021001",
    "name": "Tara Sudiman",
    "major": "Informatika",
    "gpa": 3.85,
    "birthdate": "2003-05-15"
}

### Menampilkan seluruh mahasiswa
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Filter jurusan Informatika
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?major=Informatika

### Paginasi halaman pertama
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?halaman=1&ukuran=2

### Paginasi halaman kedua
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?halaman=2&ukuran=2

### Menghapus mahasiswa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/5
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Menambahkan nilai student
POST {{baseUrl}}/scores
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "studentId": 1,
    "course": "Basis Data",
    "score": 85
}

### Menampilkan Student beserta Score
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1/scores


### Menguji Transaction - Menambahkan Score
POST {{baseUrl}}/scores
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "studentId": 1,
    "course": "Kecerdasan Buatan",
    "score": 92
}


### Menguji Rollback Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/scores
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "studentId": 1,
    "course": "Pengujian Rollback",
    "score": 80
}

